  "slug": "internet-and-cellphone",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/1464_internet-and-cellphone.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I haven’t been feeling very happy lately. Ever since my daughter got married, she has rarely come home to visit us, and the distance between us keeps growing. She either video-calls us or sends us a text every day, but we have much less time to talk face-to-face. Technology is so advanced now, yet I miss the warmth of being together as a family more than I appreciate cold, impersonal phones and computers. I’ve decided that the whole family should get together once a week, put our phones and computers aside, and cherish our time together."
  ],
  "english_full": "I haven’t been feeling very happy lately. Ever since my daughter got married, she has rarely come home to visit us, and the distance between us keeps growing. She either video-calls us or sends us a text every day, but we have much less time to talk face-to-face. Technology is so advanced now, yet I miss the warmth of being together as a family more than I appreciate cold, impersonal phones and computers. I’ve decided that the whole family should get together once a week, put our phones and computers aside, and cherish our time together.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Я не́ давно чувст­вую себя не са́мы́м счастли́вым. С тех пор как моя до́чка за́мужем, она ре́дко прихо́дит к нам до́мой, и расстоя́ние ме́жду на́ми всё бо́льше. Она та́кже зво́нит нам по видеосвязи или от­пра́вляет нам СМС-ки ка́ждый день, но у нас оста́ётся намно́го ме́нее вре́мени, чтобы поговори́ть лицом к ли́цу. Техноло́гия те́перь та́к передо́вая, но я всё е́щё скуча́ю по теплоте́ быть вместе́ как семья́ боле́е, чем оценю́ холо́дные, безли́чные телефо́ны и компью́теры. Я реши́ла, что вся семья́ должна собира́ться оди́н раз в не́делю, класть в сто́рону наши телефо́ны и компью́теры и дорожи́ть нашим вре́менем вместе́."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Ya né davno chuvstvuyu sebya ne sámým schastlivym. S tekh por kak moya dochka zámuzhem, ona rédko prikhodit k nam dómoy, i rasstōyanie mézhdu nami vsyo bólshe. Ona takzhe zvonit nam po videosviazi ili otpravljayet nam SMS-ki kázhdy den', no u nas ostayetsya namnógo menée vremeni, chtoby pogovorit' litsom k litsu. Tekhnologiya téper' tak peredovaya, no ya vsyo yeshcho skuchayu po teplotye byt' vmeste kak sem'ya bolée, chem otsenyu kholodnye, bezlichnye telefóny i komp'yutery. Ya reshilá, chto vsya sem'ya dolzhna sbirát'sya odin raz v nedelyu, klad't v storonu nashi telefóny i komp'yutery i dorozhit' nashim vremýem vmeste."
  ],
